# {{ .ProjectName }}

{{ .ProjectName }} is built with [GoForj](https://goforj.dev), the composable stack for building applications in Go.

## Getting Started

Start the local development environment from the project root:

```sh
forj dev
```

GoForj prepares the configured local services, generates framework code, builds frontend assets when present, and watches the application for changes.

## Build and Test

Build the complete application artifact:

```sh
forj build
```

Run the Go test suite:

```sh
go test ./...
```

